  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "In Fedora 3.6.1 and 3.6.2 (haven't tried 3.6.0..), the addRelationships endpoint is broken. When you send a POST request (that worked in Fedora 3.5), you get a 404:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "opening connection to localhost:8983...",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "opened",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "<- \"POST /fedora/objects/transactions%3A1/relationships/new?subject=transactions%3A1&predicate=uri%3Aasdf&object=fedora%3Aobject HTTP/1.1\\r\\nAccept: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ],
       "text": "/",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "; q=0.5, application/xml\\r\\nAccept-Encoding: gzip, deflate\\r\\nUser-Agent: Ruby\\r\\nAuthorization: Basic ZmVkb3JhQWRtaW46ZmVkb3JhQWRtaW4=\\r\\nHost: localhost:8983\\r\\nContent-Length: 0\\r\\nContent-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\\r\\n\\r\\n\"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "<- \"\"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "-> \"HTTP/1.1 404 Not Found\\r\\n\"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "-> \"Expires: Thu, 01-Jan-1970 00:00:00 GMT\\r\\n\"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "-> \"Set-Cookie: JSESSIONID=g2s8y1h6dqzbq6wevhz795wi;Path=/fedora\\r\\n\"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "-> \"Allow: POST,GET,DELETE,PUT,OPTIONS,HEAD\\r\\n\"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "-> \"Content-Length: 0\\r\\n\"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "-> \"Date: Thu, 02 May 2013 18:21:11 GMT\\r\\n\"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "-> \"Server: Jetty(6.1-SNAPSHOT)\\r\\n\"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "-> \"\\r\\n\"",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "and a not-particularly-helpful JAX-RS message in the logs:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "WARN 2013-05-02 10:47:30.533 [btpool0-1] (JAXRSUtils) No operation matching request path \"/fedora/objects/transactions%3A1/relationships/new\" is found, Relative Path: /transactions%3A1/relationships/new, HTTP Method: POST, ContentType: application/x-www-form-urlencoded, Accept: application/xml,",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ],
       "text": "/",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": ";q=0.5,. Please enable FINE/TRACE log level for more details.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
